messages.content:
{
  "message": "Thanks for the detailed checks. Your phone shows strong 5G signal and mobile data ON, but Data Roaming is OFF and the speed test failed—so the immediate blocker is that roaming is disabled on the device. We’ll fix this in two parts: (1) turn Data Roaming ON on the phone to allow data while abroad, and (2) on my side, verify your line’s roaming setting and data allowance so nothing carrier-side blocks you.",
  "what_i_will_do_and_why": [
    "Once you share your phone number, I’ll pull up your line to confirm roaming is enabled on the account and turn it on if needed (at no cost). I’ll also check your current-cycle data usage versus your plan limit in case a cap is causing loss of data.",
    "If anything is blocked due to billing/suspension, I’ll let you know and address it."
  ],
  "info_needed_from_you": {
    "phone_number": "Please provide the phone number for the affected line.",
    "location_pattern": "Does this happen everywhere you go in France (e.g., city, hotel, countryside), or just in specific places?",
    "device_type": "Are you using an iPhone or Android? (This helps tailor exact menu names.)"
  },
  "do_now_on_your_phone": [
    {
      "title": "Turn ON Data Roaming",
      "iphone": "Settings > Cellular (or Mobile Data) > Cellular Data Options > Data Roaming > ON. Then in Voice & Data, keep 5G On/Auto.",
      "android": "Settings > Network & Internet (or Connections) > Mobile network > Data roaming > ON. Ensure Preferred network type is 4G/5G."
    },
    {
      "title": "Refresh the connection",
      "steps": [
        "Toggle Airplane Mode ON for 10 seconds, then OFF.",
        "If no improvement after 1–2 minutes, restart the phone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Test and report back",
      "steps": [
        "Turn Wi‑Fi OFF temporarily so the phone uses mobile data.",
        "Run a speed test and tell me the result category (unknown/very poor/poor/fair/good/excellent).",
        "Also tell me what the status bar shows (e.g., 5G or 4G/LTE) and how many signal bars."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Roaming must be ON both on the phone and on your line. I’ll handle the line-side once I have your number.",
    "If you’ve hit your plan’s data limit, data can cut off; I can either refuel data (up to 2 GB) or discuss plan options after I check your usage."
  ]
}

