      "title": "If still stuck on 2G or no data: Reset APN and Reboot",
      "instructions": [
        "Settings > Network & Internet > Mobile network > Access Point Names (APN).",
        "Tap the three‑dot menu > Reset to default.",
        "Restart the phone (power off, wait 15 seconds, power on) and wait 1–2 minutes for the network to register."
      ],
      "reason": "Resets data/MMSC settings required for internet and MMS."
    },
    {
      "title": "If still no data after APN reset: Reseat SIM",
      "instructions": [
        "Power off the phone.",
        "Remove the SIM tray, reinsert the SIM firmly, and power back on."
      ],
      "reason": "Ensures the SIM is detected and registered correctly."
    },
    {
      "title": "Once data works: Test MMS",
      "instructions": [
        "Open Messages by Google.",
