    "Check your current cycle data usage versus plan limit to see if you’ve hit a cap.",
    "Confirm your line status is Active (not suspended) and review plan details."
  ],
  "next_steps": "Please provide your phone number (or another ID option) and the results of the check_network_status first. I’ll start the account checks immediately and guide you through any fixes based on what we see."
}

