      "step": 3,
      "title": "Confirm indicators",
      "how": "Keep Wi‑Fi OFF for now. Ensure Mobile Data is ON and Data Roaming is ON. Look for signal bars plus 4G/LTE/5G (often with a small ‘R’ for roaming)."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "title": "Retest data and MMS",
      "how": "Open your browser and load a webpage (e.g., example.com). Then try sending a small photo via your Messages app."
    }
  ],
  "why_this_helps": "MMS requires mobile data and at least a 3G/4G/5G connection. Changing the network mode to 4G/5G preferred moves you off 2G, and the brief Airplane Mode toggle forces the device to re‑register on the local network.",
