    "Whether your line is roaming-enabled on our network",
    "Your current data usage vs. plan limit (to rule out throttling/blocked data)",
    "On-device settings: mobile data, data roaming, network mode (4G/5G preferred), Data Saver, VPN, and a quick speed test"
