{
  "result": "in_progress",
  "what_i_see": "Mobile data is now working after the 2 GB refuel, but MMS still fails. The most common remaining causes are APN/MMSC configuration, messaging app permissions, Data Saver/VPN interference, or an older network mode.",
  "next_steps_in_order": [
    {
      "step": "Reset APN settings, then reboot",
      "why": "MMS depends on the MMSC URL in APN settings; if missing/incorrect, MMS fails even when data works.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: check_apn_settings and note if MMSC/MMS fields look missing or blank.",
        "Then run: reset_apn_settings",
        "Next run: reboot_device",
        "After the phone restarts, keep Wi‑Fi OFF, ensure Data Roaming is ON, and test sending an MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "If MMS still fails, check messaging app permissions",
      "why": "The messaging app must have Storage and SMS permissions to attach/send media.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: check_app_permissions(app_name=\"messaging\")",
        "If Storage and/or SMS are missing: grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"storage\") and grant_app_permission(app_name=\"messaging\", permission=\"sms\")",
        "Test MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Disable Data Saver if enabled",
      "why": "Data Saver can restrict background transfers that MMS relies on.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: check_data_restriction_status",
        "If Data Saver is ON: toggle_data_saver_mode(to=\"off\")",
        "Test MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Turn off any active VPN",
      "why": "VPNs can interfere with MMS routing.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: check_vpn_status",
        "If a VPN is connected: disconnect_vpn()",
        "Test MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Confirm network mode includes 4G/5G",
      "why": "2G/3G can break MMS even with signal; your status bar shows 4G but we’ll confirm the preference.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: check_network_mode_preference",
        "If it shows 2G or 3G: set_network_mode_preference(mode=\"4g_5g_preferred\")",
        "Test MMS again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "step": "Run an MMS capability check",
      "why": "This helps isolate if the messaging app is blocked from sending MMS.",
      "how_on_your_device": [
        "Run: can_send_mms() and share the result/message back here."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "please_confirm": "Start with the APN reset and reboot step. After the reboot, try sending an MMS and let me know what happens. If it still fails, tell me the results of the permission, Data Saver, VPN, network mode, and can_send_mms checks so I can advise the next exact fix."
