  "thought_process": "To fix slow or dropping mobile data, I’ll do two things in parallel: (1) verify your account/line status and data usage on our side (to rule out suspension, data cap, or roaming settings), and (2) guide you through targeted checks on your phone that commonly resolve speed/connectivity issues (airplane mode, signal, mobile data switch, VPN/Data Saver, network mode, and APN). This step-by-step approach lets us quickly isolate whether the cause is account/line, network conditions, or device settings so we can get you to excellent speeds.",
  "need_verification": "To begin, I need to identify your account.",
  "please_provide": [
    "The mobile phone number of the affected line (preferred)",
    "OR your Customer ID",
    "OR your full name AND date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD)"
  ],
  "quick_questions": [
    "Are you currently relying on mobile data (Wi‑Fi off) when it’s slow, or does it also happen on Wi‑Fi?",
    "Are you traveling outside your usual area or abroad right now?",
    "Is the slowness everywhere or only in certain places/times?",
    "Do you use a VPN app?",
    "Has this been ongoing or did it start recently after any changes (new phone/SIM/settings)?"
  ],
  "while_we_verify_on_our_side": "If you can, please run these quick checks on your phone now and share the results. This can immediately fix or pinpoint the issue.",
  "user_actions": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "purpose": "Confirm service, network type, and that Airplane Mode is off.",
      "action": "check_status_bar",
      "what_to_report": "Do you see any airplane icon? How many signal bars (📶¹, 📶², 📶³, 📶⁴)? What network type shows (5G/4G/LTE/3G/2G)? Is there a data icon indicating Data Enabled?"
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "purpose": "Ensure mobile data is actually on and see roaming state.",
      "action": "check_network_status",
      "what_to_report": "Is Mobile Data ON or OFF? Signal strength (none/poor/fair/good/excellent)? Is Data Roaming ON or OFF?"
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "purpose": "Measure actual mobile data performance.",
      "prep": "Turn Wi‑Fi OFF so the test uses mobile data.",
      "action": "run_speed_test",
      "what_to_report": "The result (no connection / very poor / poor / fair / good / excellent)."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "purpose": "Rule out common throttling causes on device.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "check": "check_vpn_status",
          "if": "VPN is connected",
          "then": "disconnect_vpn"
        },
        {
          "check": "check_data_restriction_status",
          "if": "Data Saver is ON",
          "then": "toggle_data_saver_mode (turn OFF)"
        }
      ],
      "what_to_report": "Whether VPN or Data Saver was ON and what you changed."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "purpose": "Ensure you’re using the fastest available network.",
      "check": "check_network_mode_preference",
      "if_not": "4g_5g_preferred",
      "then": "set_network_mode_preference to \"4g_5g_preferred\"",
      "what_to_report": "What mode it was on and what you set it to."
    }
  ],
  "note": "If steps above don’t improve things, we may reset APN settings and reboot the device, but I’ll confirm after reviewing your account/line status and your test results.",
  "next": "Please share your account identifier (phone number/Customer ID/name+DOB) and the results from steps 1–3 (and 4–5 if you had time). I’ll start the backend checks immediately and guide you to the next best fix."
}

